And Mitt Romney told me

00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:10.182
that he believed that giving

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:11.717
Tucker Carlson the security footage

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.619
and the way that Carlson portrayed it

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:16.455
was, quote, disgusting and danger Lewis.

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:18.190
And he also said it was a mistake

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:20.059
for McCarthy to give that footage.

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:20.960
Tucker Carlson.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.862
No word yet from McCarthy himself.

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:24.297
We approached him in the Capitol

00:09:24.297 --> 00:09:24.997
today, Jake,

00:09:24.997 --> 00:09:26.032
and he said he would answer

00:09:26.032 --> 00:09:28.200
questions later today about all of this,

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.969
and we'll see what he has to say.

00:09:29.969 --> 00:09:31.771
But didn't he say that last week to Manu?

00:09:31.771 --> 00:09:32.271
Didn't he say

00:09:32.271 --> 00:09:33.506
he was going to take questions last week

00:09:33.506 --> 00:09:34.607
and he never took questions?

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:36.542
He did on one day in the Capitol.

00:09:36.542 --> 00:09:38.077
The next day he answered a question.

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:39.011
So we'll see when he does.

00:09:39.011 --> 00:09:41.013
Okay. Well, let's see what he does.

00:09:41.013 --> 00:09:42.415
Manu Raju on Capitol Hill, thank you.

